Each Claude marketplace source names a plugin root containing .claude-plugin/plugin.json, and the auto-sync hook relies on that path shape to find the authoritative version manifest; nothing enforces that a source resolves to a plugin root — the hook silently skips any entry whose derived plugin.json is absent, and the layout check that once asserted every source path exists was retired with packages/plugin-layout-checks.
